# Components

**Status:** current. `??` field defaults are **experimental**.

```text
@component Name = |params| html
@component Name = |params| { template }
```

| Rule | Contract |
| --- | --- |
| Name | PascalCase. Consecutive leading capitals (`HTMLShell`) rejected; write `HtmlShell`. |
| Generated name | camelCase Roc function (`StatusCard` → `statusCard`). |
| One root | Braces optional for a single tag, call, or fragment. |
| Braces required | `@let`, `@css`, `@if`/`@for`/`@match`, or multiple roots. |
| First param | Normally a props record. |
| Extra param | Default body; paired tags pass nested markup as `Html`. |
| `??` defaults | Allowed in `.rocci`; lowering emits `{ name : Str ?? "Roc" }` and a stripped pattern. Omitted fields use the Roc default. |

There is no magic `children` field and no runtime component registry.
`rocci view --component Hello` and `--component hello` both select the function.

**Example:** [Styling Hello](/examples/styling/source/Styling-rocci/).

**Related:** [Tags](/docs/reference/language/tags/),
[Components guide](/docs/templates/components/).
